    },
    {
        "text": "Oof... Ah.. That hurts a little...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gavial"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_187_ccheal_1#2",
        "name2": "char_411_tomimi_1#2",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "camerashake",
        "duration": 0.6,
        "xstrength": 10,
        "ystrength": 12,
        "vibrato": 30,
        "randomness": 90,
        "fadeout": true,
        "block": false
    },
    {
        "text": "Gavial, you're awake! Are you okay?!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Tomimi"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_187_ccheal_1#2",
        "name2": "char_411_tomimi_1#2",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "I'm fine. Just a scratch.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gavial"
    },
    {
        "text": "More importantly, is that the machine Zumama's been tinkering with all this time?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gavial"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_187_ccheal_1#2",
        "name2": "char_411_tomimi_1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Yes. I heard them calling it 'The Big, Ugly Thing.' So gross...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Tomimi"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_187_ccheal_1#5",
        "name2": "char_411_tomimi_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "It's pretty badass!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gavial"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_187_ccheal_1#5",
        "name2": "char_411_tomimi_1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "So... Err, huh?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Tomimi"
    },
    {
        "text": "But the big thing definitely beat you down...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Tomimi"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_187_ccheal_1#3",
        "name2": "char_411_tomimi_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "I can tell it's really tough, even through it knocked my lights out before I got a good look at it.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gavial"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_187_ccheal_1#3",
        "name2": "char_411_tomimi_1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Hmm, yes it is...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Tomimi"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_187_ccheal_1#3",
        "name2": "char_411_tomimi_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "But I never imagined she'd actually put together something like this.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gavial"
    },
    {
        "text": "Closure makes some weird gadgets every once in a while, yeah, but even she'd be impressed with Zumama's machine here. Haha.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gavial"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_187_ccheal_1#3",
        "name2": "char_411_tomimi_1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Wow, are there lots of things like that at Rhodes Island?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Tomimi"
    },
    {
        "tag": "decision",
        "options": "Yes.;......;Not that ugly.",
        "values": "1;2;3"
    },
    {
        "tag": "predicate",
        "references": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_411_tomimi_1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Waaaa! Rhodes Island sounds scary...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Tomimi"
    },
    {
        "tag": "predicate",
        "references": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_187_ccheal_1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Haha, Rhodes Island would blow your little mind.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gavial"
    },
    {
        "tag": "predicate",
        "references": 3
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_187_ccheal_1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Haha, now that you mention it, that thing would drive Closure up the wall as soon as she laid eyes on it.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gavial"
    },
    {
        "tag": "predicate",
        "references": "1;2;3"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_187_ccheal_1#2",
        "name2": "char_411_tomimi_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Hm? What happened to the Temple?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gavial"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_187_ccheal_1#2",
        "name2": "char_411_tomimi_1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "That monster blew it up.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Tomimi"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_187_ccheal_1#2",
        "name2": "char_411_tomimi_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Oh, so that means the ceremony's over?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gavial"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_187_ccheal_1#2",
        "name2": "char_411_tomimi_1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Yes.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Tomimi"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_187_ccheal_1#2",
        "name2": "char_411_tomimi_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "And so Zumama's the Great Chief now?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gavial"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_187_ccheal_1#2",
        "name2": "char_411_tomimi_1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Yes...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Tomimi"
    },
    {
        "text": "Everyone was pretty shocked at first, but...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Tomimi"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
