        "fadetime": 1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_416_zumama_1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Why did I destroy the Temple? It's simple.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Eunectes"
    },
    {
        "text": "It's my way of telling you all we're ending this tradition.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Eunectes"
    },
    {
        "text": "With your fists, you can beat down ten men. If you're Gavial, maybe you take a hundred. But more than that?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Eunectes"
    },
    {
        "text": "Even Gavial couldn't manage.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Eunectes"
    },
    {
        "text": "There's a limit to what you can do with your fists.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Eunectes"
    },
    {
        "text": "But with a tool? That's different. My tribe created this 'Big, Ugly Thing' that effortlessly took down Gavial and destroyed the Temple just as easily.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Eunectes"
    },
    {
        "text": "This is the power of a tool.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Eunectes"
    },
    {
        "text": "Tools can make you all even stronger!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Eunectes"
    },
    {
        "text": "And so I hereby proclaim the age of machines!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Eunectes"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "background",
        "image": "bg_temple_2",
        "screenadapt": "coverall"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_187_ccheal_1",
        "name2": "char_411_tomimi_1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Everyone bought into it, so...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Tomimi"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_187_ccheal_1",
        "name2": "char_411_tomimi_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "So she became the Great Chief. Hah, well, that's an L for me, obviously.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gavial"
    },
    {
        "tag": "decision",
        "options": "Are you okay with that?;......;You're right to accept it, Gavial.",
        "values": "1;2;3"
    },
    {
        "tag": "predicate",
        "references": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_187_ccheal_1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Huh? Yep. A loss is a loss.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gavial"
    },
    {
        "tag": "predicate",
        "references": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_187_ccheal_1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Hey, Doctor, I don't need your comfort. I'm really fine.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gavial"
    },
    {
        "tag": "predicate",
        "references": 3
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_187_ccheal_1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Hmph, duh. Do you know me?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gavial"
    },
    {
        "tag": "predicate",
        "references": "1;2;3"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_187_ccheal_1",
        "name2": "char_411_tomimi_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Oh, but I have to apologize to Tomimi. It's my fault you never got a chance to fight.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gavial"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_187_ccheal_1",
        "name2": "char_411_tomimi_1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "...That's okay. Even if I went up there, it wouldn't have changed anything.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Tomimi"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_187_ccheal_1",
        "name2": "char_411_tomimi_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Yeah, you're right about that one.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gavial"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_187_ccheal_1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Hey, Doctor, what do we do now?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gavial"
    },
    {
        "tag": "decision",
        "options": "Find the engine and the others.;......;Sightseeing?",
        "values": "1;2;3"
    },
    {
        "tag": "predicate",
        "references": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_187_ccheal_1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Ah, right! We need the engine to get back.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gavial"
    },
    {
        "text": "And as for the others, if we didn't see them at the ceremony, maybe they got lost?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gavial"
    },
    {
        "tag": "predicate",
        "references": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_187_ccheal_1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Still thinking it over, Doctor? No rush. We've got some vacation time left.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gavial"
    },
    {
        "tag": "predicate",
        "references": 3
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_187_ccheal_1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Haha, I love this Doctor! Then let's get some sightseeing in while we look for the engine and the girls.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gavial"
    },
    {
        "tag": "predicate",
        "references": "1;2;3"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_411_tomimi_1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Erm, well...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Tomimi"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_187_ccheal_1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Huh? Those two over there...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gavial"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_070",
        "name2": "avg_npc_071",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Hey, Yota, are you okay?!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Archosauria A"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_070",
        "name2": "avg_npc_071",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Yeah, it's just, it kinda...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Archosauria B"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_070",
        "name2": "avg_npc_071",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Yota!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Archosauria A"
    },
    {
        "text": "I need a shaman!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Archosauria A"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_187_ccheal_1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Hey, let me take a look.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gavial"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_187_ccheal_1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_070",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "camerashake",
        "duration": 0.3,
        "xstrength": 10,
        "ystrength": 12,
        "vibrato": 30,
        "randomness": 90,
        "fadeout": true,
        "block": false
    },
    {
        "text": "Gavial? You're alive?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Archosauria A"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_187_ccheal_1#2",
        "name2": "avg_npc_070",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Takes more than that to kill me.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gavial"
    },
    {
        "text": "Shut up for now. Lay your brother out and I'll look him over.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gavial"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_187_ccheal_1#2",
        "name2": "char_411_tomimi_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Tomimi, get my medical bag.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gavial"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_187_ccheal_1#2",
        "name2": "char_411_tomimi_1#2",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Oh, okay!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Tomimi"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
