    },
    {
        "tag": "camerashake",
        "duration": 0.3,
        "xstrength": 10,
        "ystrength": 12,
        "vibrato": 30,
        "randomness": 90,
        "fadeout": true,
        "block": false
    },
    {
        "text": "Is he gonna be alright?!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Archosauria A"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_187_ccheal_1#2",
        "name2": "avg_npc_070",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "He's not dead. But he's not looking good either.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gavial"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_187_ccheal_1#4"
    },
    {
        "text": "Shortness of breath, foamy, bloody spittle... Hm? And Originium crystals on the body?!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gavial"
    },
    {
        "text": "...Doctor, my initial diagnosis is heart failure brought on by Oripathy.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gavial"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_187_ccheal_1#4",
        "name2": "avg_npc_070",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "What?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Archosauria A"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_187_ccheal_1#2",
        "name2": "avg_npc_070",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "It's Stone Disease. The symptoms aren't too bad. I have some emergency medicine in my bag, but we need to treat him right away.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gavial"
    },
    {
        "text": "Stand him up. He can't lay down. I'll give him some oxygen.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gavial"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_187_ccheal_1#2",
        "name2": "avg_npc_070",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "The Stone Disease did this? Ugh, I told him not to push it.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Archosauria A"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_187_ccheal_1#4",
        "name2": "avg_npc_070",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gavial"
    },
    {
        "text": "Hey, what's your name?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gavial"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_187_ccheal_1#4",
        "name2": "avg_npc_070",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "I'm Yogi. That's my brother, Yota.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Archosauria A"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_187_ccheal_1#2",
        "name2": "avg_npc_070",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Which tribe?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gavial"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_187_ccheal_1#2",
        "name2": "avg_npc_070",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Eunectes.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Yogi"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_187_ccheal_1#4"
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gavial"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_187_ccheal_1#4",
        "name2": "char_411_tomimi_1#4",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "What's wrong, Gavial? Your face is scaring me.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Tomimi"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_187_ccheal_1#4",
        "name2": "char_411_tomimi_1#4",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Not now.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gavial"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_187_ccheal_1#4",
        "name2": "avg_npc_070",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "I'm asking again: Did Zumama send you into the mines to get ore for her big metal monster?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gavial"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_187_ccheal_1#4",
        "name2": "avg_npc_070",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Yes. Why?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Yogi"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_187_ccheal_1#4"
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gavial"
    },
    {
        "text": "I'm sorry, Doctor. No matter what, I have to pay Zumama a visit.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gavial"
    },
    {
        "tag": "decision",
        "options": "Because of the 'Stone Disease'?;......;I guess sightseeing can wait.",
        "values": "1;2;3"
    },
    {
        "tag": "predicate",
        "references": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_187_ccheal_1#2"
    },
    {
        "text": "Nothing gets past you, Doctor.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gavial"
    },
    {
        "tag": "predicate",
        "references": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_187_ccheal_1#2"
    },
    {
        "text": "You're the Doctor, you definitely know why.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gavial"
    },
    {
        "tag": "predicate",
        "references": 3
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_187_ccheal_1#4"
    },
    {
        "text": "Sorry again, Doctor. But I have to do this.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gavial"
    },
    {
        "tag": "predicate",
        "references": "1;2;3"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_187_ccheal_1#4"
    },
    {
        "text": "Our tribes don't have much contact with the outside world. To you and the other operators, we're a primitive backwater.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gavial"
    },
    {
        "text": "But there is one good thing about this place. You heard it, right? They call Oripathy 'Stone Disease' and treat it like an ordinary malady.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gavial"
    },
    {
        "text": "Sometimes people catch it, sometimes they die of it. But nobody thinks it's anything special, because people here die from lots of things.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gavial"
    },
    {
        "text": "Everyone looks after Oripathy patients like they're just regular sick people. All they know about the disease is you can catch it in the mines.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gavial"
    },
    {
        "text": "So very few people go into the mines. It's been that way for a long time.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gavial"
    },
    {
        "tag": "decision",
        "options": "Your Oripathy...",
        "values": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "predicate",
        "references": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_411_tomimi_1#5"
    },
    {
        "text": "Gavial caught it when she saved me.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Tomimi"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_187_ccheal_1#4",
        "name2": "char_411_tomimi_1#5",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Yeah. When Tomimi was little, she snuck into the depths of the mines. I went to rescue her, and I got sick.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gavial"
    },
    {
        "text": "Lucky she didn't.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gavial"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_187_ccheal_1#4",
        "name2": "char_411_tomimi_1#5",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "If only I got it instead...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Tomimi"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_187_ccheal_1#2",
        "name2": "char_411_tomimi_1#5",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Don't you dare say that. Getting sick is a terrible thing. It's just bad luck.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gavial"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_187_ccheal_1#2",
        "name2": "char_411_tomimi_1#6",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "(Whimper)",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Tomimi"
    },
    {
        "tag": "decision",
        "options": "So they really ostracized you out of here?",
        "values": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "predicate",
        "references": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_187_ccheal_1#2"
    },
    {
        "text": "You've asked that a couple of times, Doctor.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gavial"
    },
    {
        "text": "After I got sick, the other tribespeople wouldn't let me do anything. I couldn't hunt, I couldn't even go to a gathering.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gavial"
    },
    {
        "text": "And the little runt Tomimi here was the worst. She came over from her tribe and stuck to me like glue. She did everything for me, and I had nothing to do.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gavial"
    },
    {
        "text": "In the end, they wouldn't even let me join the ceremony.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gavial"
    },
    {
        "text": "Day after day, time after time, it was 'Oh no, Gavial, let me do that for you,' you know what I mean...? That's no life for me.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gavial"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_411_tomimi_1#7"
    },
    {
        "text": "Gavial didn't smile much after that...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Tomimi"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_187_ccheal_1#4"
    },
    {
        "text": "I was so pissed off, I went to the ceremony anyway, and beat the tar out of everyone I saw on the way.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gavial"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_187_ccheal_1#4",
        "name2": "char_411_tomimi_1#6",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "*Sob*, I shouldn't have been so pushy, Gavial...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Tomimi"
    },
    {
        "tag": "decision",
        "options": "...That really is a kind of ostracization.;......;Sure wish someone would ostracize me like that!",
        "values": "1;2;3"
    },
    {
        "tag": "predicate",
        "references": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_187_ccheal_1#4"
    },
    {
        "text": "The reality is, around here, if you can't fight, you're nothing. A waste of space.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gavial"
    },
    {
        "text": "I'd rather you let me put myself in danger than take away my freedom to do anything.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gavial"
    },
    {
        "tag": "predicate",
        "references": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_187_ccheal_1#2"
    },
    {
        "text": "Doctor, don't you think this is funny?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gavial"
    },
    {
        "text": "I think it's funny. Only after I left the tribe did I realize what kind of hatred people have for Oripathy sufferers.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gavial"
    },
    {
        "text": "It took me a long time to figure that out.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gavial"
    },
    {
        "tag": "predicate",
        "references": 3
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_187_ccheal_1#4"
    },
    {
        "text": "Tch, watch that tongue of yours, Doctor, or I'll rip it out.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gavial"
    },
    {
        "text": "But I know what you mean. Out there, discrimination is what you get as an Oripathy patient.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gavial"
    },
    {
        "text": "What I went through back then, though, that was still torture for me.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gavial"
    },
    {
        "tag": "predicate",
        "references": "1;2;3"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_187_ccheal_1#4"
    },
    {
        "text": "Hey, you got me off on a tangent there. This isn't what I wanted to talk about.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gavial"
    },
    {
        "text": "Hmm... What was I saying?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gavial"
    },
    {
        "tag": "decision",
        "options": "Big metal monster.;......;The cash you owe me.",
        "values": "1;2;3"
    },
    {
        "tag": "predicate",
        "references": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_187_ccheal_1#2"
    },
    {
        "text": "Oh, right.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gavial"
    },
    {
        "tag": "predicate",
        "references": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_187_ccheal_1#2"
    },
    {
        "text": "Doctor, help me out here.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gavial"
    },
    {
        "text": "Oh, I got it.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gavial"
    },
    {
        "tag": "predicate",
        "references": 3
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_187_ccheal_1#4"
    },
    {
        "text": "Bullshit.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gavial"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_187_ccheal_1#2"
    },
    {
        "text": "Oh, I got it.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gavial"
    },
    {
        "tag": "predicate",
        "references": "1;2;3"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_187_ccheal_1#4"
    },
    {
        "text": "I was thinking about how that great big monster of a machine must've taken a ton of iron ore to build.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gavial"
    },
    {
        "text": "Put that together with what Zumama was saying, and we know she definitely sent her people down into the mines to get that ore.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gavial"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_411_tomimi_1#2"
    },
    {
        "text": "Now that you mention it, I have heard something like that.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Tomimi"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_187_ccheal_1#4"
    },
    {
        "text": "Now I've got no problem with that, on its face. If she just had them digging around on the outside, no big deal.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gavial"
    },
    {
        "text": "But now people are getting sick, and I have to do something.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gavial"
    },
    {
        "text": "I don't care about her age of machines or whatever. If she's throwing away lives, she's earned a clobbering.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gavial"
    },
    {
        "tag": "decision",
        "options": "You have my full support.;......;You're a good doctor, Gavial.",
        "values": "1;2;3"
    },
    {
        "tag": "predicate",
        "references": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_187_ccheal_1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Thanks, Doctor.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gavial"
    },
    {
        "tag": "predicate",
        "references": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_187_ccheal_1#2"
    },
    {
        "text": "Ooh, you've got that penetrating gaze, Doctor.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gavial"
    },
    {
        "tag": "predicate",
        "references": 3
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_187_ccheal_1#2"
    },
    {
        "text": "Hah, but of course.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gavial"
    },
    {
        "tag": "predicate",
        "references": "1;2;3"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_187_ccheal_1#2",
        "name2": "char_411_tomimi_1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Gavial...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Tomimi"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_411_tomimi_1"
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Tomimi"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_187_ccheal_1#2",
        "name2": "char_411_tomimi_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Tomimi, where is Zumama's tribe?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gavial"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_187_ccheal_1#2",
        "name2": "char_411_tomimi_1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Um, I don't know.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Tomimi"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_187_ccheal_1#2",
        "name2": "avg_npc_070",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Hey, Gavial, I'm really not interested in your hopes and dreams and ideals here. What's up with my brother?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Yogi"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_187_ccheal_1#2",
        "name2": "avg_npc_070",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Huh? You can understand our Sargonian?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gavial"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_187_ccheal_1#2",
        "name2": "avg_npc_070",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Yes. The leader taught all of us.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Yogi"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_187_ccheal_1#2",
        "name2": "avg_npc_070",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "...What is that Zumama up to?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gavial"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_187_ccheal_1#2",
        "name2": "char_411_tomimi_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Whatever. Anyway, Tomimi, get your minions to carry this one back to your tribe. Have Lancet-2 start treating him.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gavial"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_187_ccheal_1#2",
        "name2": "avg_npc_070",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Hey, what are you doing?!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Yogi"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_187_ccheal_1#4",
        "name2": "avg_npc_070",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "If you want your brother to live, you'll put your trust in me.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gavial"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_187_ccheal_1#4",
        "name2": "char_411_tomimi_1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "...Okay then, I'll take him back with me.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Tomimi"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_187_ccheal_1#2",
        "name2": "char_411_tomimi_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Oh? You're not coming with me?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gavial"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_187_ccheal_1#2",
        "name2": "char_411_tomimi_1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Ah! N-No! Of course I want to go with you, Gavial. But I have a few things that need doing first. I'll catch up with you later!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Tomimi"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_187_ccheal_1#2",
        "name2": "char_411_tomimi_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "What things? Need my help?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gavial"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_187_ccheal_1#2",
        "name2": "char_411_tomimi_1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "N-No! I can take care of it myself!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Tomimi"
    },
    {
        "text": "Gavial, do you remember the great waterfall? We'll meet up there!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Tomimi"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_187_ccheal_1#2",
        "name2": "char_411_tomimi_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Okay.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gavial"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_187_ccheal_1#2",
        "name2": "avg_npc_070",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Alright. You're the one and only Gavial, I trust you. But I'm going with!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Yogi"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_187_ccheal_1#4",
        "name2": "avg_npc_070",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "No, you won't be any help. And there's something I need you to do for me.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gavial"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_187_ccheal_1#4",
        "name2": "avg_npc_070",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "What?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Yogi"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_187_ccheal_1#4",
        "name2": "avg_npc_070",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Go tell Zumama we need to have a talk.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gavial"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
